   "npc": "4783",
   "questID": 1200,
   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Kelris has eluded us for quite some time.\n\nIt seems as though whenever evil made its presence known in these parts, Kelris had played a role. For some time we considered him dead or missing.\n\nBut this makes perfect sense. By ending his reign you have spared the lives of many innocent people.\n\nBy the light! To sacrifice someone to a servant of an Old God for one's personal gain is beyond reproachful!\n\nYou have done a great deed, $N. I salute you on behalf of the Argent Dawn.",
   "time": 1790982408,
   "title": "Blackfathom Villainy",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Darnassus"
  },
